---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Navbar from "../../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import Section from "../../components/Section.astro";

const title = "Privacy Policy";
const lastUpdated = "13 April 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description="Sueste Creative privacy policy: how we collect, use and protect your personal data in compliance with GDPR."
  lang="en"
  hreflangPt="https://sueste-creative.pt/privacidade"
  hreflangEn="https://sueste-creative.pt/en/privacy"
>
  <Navbar />
  <main class="legal-page">
    <Section title={title} subtitle={`Last updated: ${lastUpdated}`}>
      <div class="legal-content glass p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl">

        <h3>1. Data Controller</h3>
        <p>
          The data controller responsible for your personal data is
          <strong>Sueste Creative</strong>, contactable at:
          <a href="mailto:info@sueste-creative.pt">info@sueste-creative.pt</a>.
        </p>

        <h3>2. Data We Collect</h3>
        <p>We collect data you provide directly through our forms:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Contact form:</strong> name, email address and message.</li>
          <li><strong>Quote calculator:</strong> name, email, company, deadline, selected services and additional notes.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We also collect anonymous, aggregated browsing data via Google Analytics
          (see the Cookies section).
        </p>

        <h3>3. Purpose and Legal Basis for Processing</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Responding to enquiries and quotes.</strong> Legal basis:
            pre-contractual measures (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR).
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Providing contracted services.</strong> Legal basis:
            performance of a contract (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR).
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Sending marketing communications.</strong> Legal basis:
            consent (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR). You may withdraw consent at any time
            via the unsubscribe link in any communication or by emailing
            <a href="mailto:info@sueste-creative.pt">info@sueste-creative.pt</a>.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h3>4. Retention Period</h3>
        <p>
          Data submitted through our contact and quote forms is retained for a
          maximum of <strong>2 years</strong> from the date of last interaction,
          unless a legal obligation or ongoing contract requires a different
          retention period.
        </p>

        <h3>5. Sub-processors and Data Transfers</h3>
        <p>
          We use third-party service providers who act as sub-processors and
          handle your data only according to our instructions:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Resend Inc.:</strong> transactional email delivery.
            Data processed in EU servers (eu-west-1, Ireland).
            <a href="https://resend.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Policy</a>.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Cloudflare Inc.:</strong> website hosting and security.
            May transfer data outside the EU under standard contractual clauses.
            <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Policy</a>.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Google LLC (Analytics):</strong> anonymous traffic analysis.
            Data processed in the US under the EU-US Data Privacy Framework.
            <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Policy</a>.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We may also share necessary data with partner collaborators (such as
          photographers or other creative service providers) solely for the
          execution of projects that involve them, with your knowledge.
        </p>

        <h3>6. Your Rights</h3>
        <p>Under GDPR, you have the following rights regarding your personal data:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Access:</strong> find out what data we hold about you.</li>
          <li><strong>Rectification:</strong> correct inaccurate or incomplete data.</li>
          <li><strong>Erasure:</strong> request deletion of your data ("right to be forgotten").</li>
          <li><strong>Portability:</strong> receive your data in a structured, machine-readable format.</li>
          <li><strong>Objection:</strong> object to processing for direct marketing purposes.</li>
          <li><strong>Restriction:</strong> request temporary suspension of processing.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          To exercise any of these rights, contact us at
          <a href="mailto:info@sueste-creative.pt">info@sueste-creative.pt</a>.
          We will respond within 30 days.
        </p>
        <p>
          You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the Portuguese data
          protection authority:
          <a href="https://www.cnpd.pt" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Comissão Nacional de Proteção de Dados (CNPD)</a>.
        </p>

        <h3>7. Cookies</h3>
        <p>
          Our website uses cookies. For detailed information, please see our
          <a href="/en/cookies">Cookie Policy</a>.
        </p>

        <h3>8. Security</h3>
        <p>
          We adopt appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect
          your data against unauthorised access, loss, destruction or disclosure,
          including encrypted transmission (HTTPS) and restricted data access.
        </p>

        <h3>9. Changes to This Policy</h3>
        <p>
          We may update this policy periodically. For material changes, we will
          publish the new version on this page with a revised update date. We
          recommend checking this page regularly.
        </p>

        <h3>10. Contact</h3>
        <p>
          For any questions regarding the protection of your personal data,
          contact us at:
          <a href="mailto:info@sueste-creative.pt">info@sueste-creative.pt</a>
        </p>

      </div>
    </Section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding-top: 80px;
  }
  .legal-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .legal-content p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    opacity: 0.8;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .legal-content ul {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
  .legal-content li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    list-style-type: disc;
  }
  .legal-content a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    opacity: 1;
  }
  .legal-content a:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
</style>
